* Hello, 世界

Welcome to a tour of the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000001⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000002⟫ programming language]].

The tour is divided into a list of modules that you can
access by clicking on
[[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000003⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000004⟫]] on the top left of the page.

You can also view the table of contents at any time by clicking on the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000005⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000006⟫]] on the top right of the page.

Throughout the tour you will find a series of slides and exercises for you
to complete.

You can navigate through them using

- [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000007⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000008⟫]] or ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000009⟫PageUp⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000010⟫ to go to the previous page,

- [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000011⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000012⟫]] or ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000013⟫PageDown⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000014⟫ to go to the next page.

The tour is interactive. Click the
[[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000015⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000016⟫]] button now
(or press ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000017⟫Shift⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000018⟫ + ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000019⟫Enter⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000020⟫) to compile and run the program on
a remote server.
The result is displayed below the code.

These example programs demonstrate different aspects of ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000021⟫. The programs in the tour are meant to be starting points for your own experimentation.

Edit the program and run it again.

When you click on [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000022⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000023⟫]]
(shortcut: ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000024⟫Ctrl⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000025⟫ + ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000026⟫Enter⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000027⟫), the text in the editor is formatted using the
[[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000028⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000029⟫]] tool. You can switch syntax highlighting on and off
by clicking on the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000030⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000031⟫]] button.

When you're ready to move on, click the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000032⟫][right arrow]] below or type the ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000033⟫PageDown⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000034⟫ key.

